<title>ITALY: Italy's CSP presents to Consob for bourse listing.</title>
<headline>Italy's CSP presents to Consob for bourse listing.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian hosiery company CSP International on Monday said it had made a presentation to Italy's stock market watchdog Consob on June 4 in order to obtain a listing on the Milan bourse.</p>
<p>The group's shareholders meeting in April gave the go-ahead for the board to progress towards gaining a quote on the Milan bourse, where its global co-ordinator is UBS.</p>
<p>The offer will include a public share offer, where the lead manager is Cariplo, and a placing with institutions jointly led by Cariplo and UBS.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
